{
 "meta": {
  "lane": "a",
  "task": "t119",
  "chunk": "a/029",
  "family": "NOR10"
 },
 "entries": [
  {
   "key": "u07629",
   "en": "If the Alliance is missing its chance, it's because of men like Udina. Not the rest of the galaxy holding us back.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07630",
   "en": "Of course, your opinion is the one that matters. Commander.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07631",
   "en": "Staying reasonable is about all we've got left.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07632",
   "en": "Everyone else in this galaxy seems to have gone out of their minds.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07633",
   "en": "Present company excepted, of course.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07634",
   "en": "Straight up? There's something wrong with all of this.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07635",
   "en": "Fair enough. Truth is, there's something wrong with all of this.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07636",
   "en": "They're on your side. They're pissed about the resistance we're getting. Especially from \"our side.\"",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07637",
   "en": "I'll have a better handle on all of it when my head stops hurting. Another L2 flare-up.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07638",
   "en": "No, Commander. It'll settle down.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07639",
   "en": "Besides, I fared a lot better than some after Conatix was through.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07640",
   "en": "No, thanks, Commander. One slip and you can't remember your own name.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07641",
   "en": "And it'd be a cold day before I turn myself over to a Conatix subsidiary.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07642",
   "en": "Yeah, they quietly disappeared. Broke up into a bunch of little corps after they botched the training on Jump Zero.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07643",
   "en": "It's a big galaxy, Lieutenant. Who knows what will come in handy?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07644",
   "en": "I want to know everything my crew is capable of, Lieutenant. We're out of our element here.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07645",
   "en": "Did he ever face charges for that?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07646",
   "en": "You're a hell of a biotic, though. He must have done something right.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07647",
   "en": "I want to know you're on our side. Whatever needs to be done.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07648",
   "en": "You're free to believe whatever you want, Lieutenant. Just follow orders.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07649",
   "en": "As long as you remember that, we'll do fine, Lieutenant.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07650",
   "en": "A reasonable stance. Keep that level head and we'll do fine.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07651",
   "en": "All right, let's label it officially off the record. Got something on your mind?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07652",
   "en": "Like I've got time to write you up. You have something you want to say, feel free.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07653",
   "en": "Is this going to be a problem?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07654",
   "en": "Ever thought about going back under the knife? Maybe get an upgrade?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07655",
   "en": "Got a story there, Alenko?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07656",
   "en": "I haven't heard anything about Conatix in a while.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07657",
   "en": "You never know.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07658",
   "en": "I'll decide that.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07659",
   "en": "They ever bust the guy?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07660",
   "en": "But did his training work?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07661",
   "en": "Sounds like quite the jolt.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07662",
   "en": "Think what you want. Quietly.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07663",
   "en": "Off the record.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07664",
   "en": "Just give me your thoughts.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07665",
   "en": "Don't make a habit of it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07666",
   "en": "Can't you retrofit to L3s?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07667",
   "en": "Tell me about it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07668",
   "en": "They still around?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07669",
   "en": "They must figure us for one more gang of FNGs looking for a handout.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07670",
   "en": "I understand, ma'am. I won't let you down.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07671",
   "en": "I appreciate that, Commander. I just don't want you to think that I'm a-- a whiner.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07672",
   "en": "All right, enough chatter. Let's move out, people.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07673",
   "en": "I always make time for my officers.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07674",
   "en": "We've got our orders. Bellyaching won't change them.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07675",
   "en": "We have to depend on each other in combat. I like knowing what kind of man I have at my back.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07676",
   "en": "Of course. But I don't enjoy it with everyone. We'll talk again later.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07677",
   "en": "Alenko, there's no regulation that says you can't be friends with your commander.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07678",
   "en": "We have to work to measure up.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07679",
   "en": "Let's move out.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07680",
   "en": "What do you expect me to do?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07681",
   "en": "I want to know my crew.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07682",
   "en": "To some degree.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07683",
   "en": "You can talk to me, you know.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07684",
   "en": "Uh, Dr. T'Soni. Ma'am.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07685",
   "en": "I'll try to keep the deck dry.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07686",
   "en": "Dead on. Turians, actually. That's why Conatix kept it a secret.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07687",
   "en": "I didn't say you needed it. I said I'm offering it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07688",
   "en": "I've been getting some signals. Not distress signals, but pretty strong.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07689",
   "en": "Vyrnnus didn't just push us because it was effective training. He liked it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07690",
   "en": "I didn't figure you'd have time to talk, with all that's going on.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07691",
   "en": "After-action debriefs. What we found out about Sovereign.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07692",
   "en": "There's got to be some xenobiologists who want to read about the Thorian.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07693",
   "en": "I mean, there are reports to file. On the rachni, and on Anoleis.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07694",
   "en": "There's got to be some archaeologists who want a report on the destruction of that ruin.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07695",
   "en": "I won't keep you, then. Commander.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07696",
   "en": "Yeah. I guess some things carry across species well enough.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07697",
   "en": "Before I met Vyrnnus, I knew as much as any other civilian. Aliens were weird, superior, and tried to tell us what to do. ",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07698",
   "en": "He didn't deser--",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07699",
   "en": "It killed him, Shepard.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07700",
   "en": "Maybe we should push for a bigger role when we wrap this up.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07701",
   "en": "If it comes down to it, I am a soldier. I have to believe that my superiors can tell our enemies from people who disagree with us.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07702",
   "en": "Sorry. I have some strong feelings on the subject.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07703",
   "en": "I should return to my duties now. Commander.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07704",
   "en": "I'm not in high school any more, Shepard.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07705",
   "en": "It's a little surprising. Given all you've said about the Council races.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07706",
   "en": "Of course. Pull up a tree stump.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07707",
   "en": "Of course. Have a seat.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07708",
   "en": "Do you think I've made any bad decisions so far?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07709",
   "en": "All right, Alenko. Off the record, permission to speak candidly, cross my heart and hope to die. What are you talking about? ",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07710",
   "en": "Look, there's nothing between Liara and me. What's the real issue here, Kaidan?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07711",
   "en": "I'd love to, but I haven't the faintest idea what you're talking about.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07712",
   "en": "You're talking about a particular example, aren't you?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07713",
   "en": "The only experts would have to be aliens.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07714",
   "en": "The asari would have been more acceptable than the turians.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07715",
   "en": "I'm a big girl, Alenko. I don't need your help.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07716",
   "en": "Important, huh?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07717",
   "en": "Sounds like a classic drill instructor to me. The ones at the Macapá boot camp were brutal.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07718",
   "en": "Your concerns have been noted, Lieutenant. Dismissed.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07719",
   "en": "What \"corners\" are we talking about?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07720",
   "en": "The paperwork will keep. Something on your mind?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07721",
   "en": "I'll probably be up half the night working on them.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07722",
   "en": "All in triplicate, I'm sure. Did you want to see me?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07723",
   "en": "All those words, and you still said nothing.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07724",
   "en": "Wanting to believe everything will be fine? Sounds like human nature to me.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07725",
   "en": "I'm glad to hear the bastard got what he deserved.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07726",
   "en": "Like I said, he deserved it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07727",
   "en": "He deserved it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07728",
   "en": "I wouldn't shed any tears over Vyrnnus.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07729",
   "en": "I'm not saying we should kick the applecart over. They need someone willing to deal with threats like Saren. I don't see anyone else stepping up.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07730",
   "en": "I've got a lot of the galaxy to see before I start flying a desk.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07731",
   "en": "I don't know. You don't seem angry about the Council strong-arming the Alliance.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07732",
   "en": "Lieutenant, I believe we need to get you a posting in recruitment.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07733",
   "en": "They don't want to deal with reality. They want to believe the whole galaxy's as cautious as they are. That no one can surpass their power.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07734",
   "en": "About Liara and me... Is everything all right?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07735",
   "en": "Cute way to look at it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07736",
   "en": "You think that's a danger?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07737",
   "en": "\"Cutting corners?\"",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07738",
   "en": "Stop being vague.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07739",
   "en": "You have an example.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07740",
   "en": "I'm sure they meant well.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07741",
   "en": "Experts?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07742",
   "en": "Why not the asari?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07743",
   "en": "I don't need you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07744",
   "en": "\"Important?\"",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07745",
   "en": "That's military discipline.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07746",
   "en": "My interests?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07747",
   "en": "They can wait.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07748",
   "en": "Yes, I'm too busy to talk.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07749",
   "en": "Probably. Screw it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07750",
   "en": "Spit it out.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07751",
   "en": "You can't blame them.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07752",
   "en": "You forgave him?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07753",
   "en": "He was just an ass.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07754",
   "en": "So what happened?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07755",
   "en": "Vyrnnus.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07756",
   "en": "At least you got it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07757",
   "en": "Vyrnnus got what was coming.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07758",
   "en": "I respect that.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07759",
   "en": "I'm just frustrated.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07760",
   "en": "They need an aggressive voice.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07761",
   "en": "Maybe in 30 years.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07762",
   "en": "Do you?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07763",
   "en": "Quite a speech.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07764",
   "en": "They live in fantasyland.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07765",
   "en": "Liara and I.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07766",
   "en": "I don't know if it's going to be enough. It's clear they need more people like you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07767",
   "en": "I hope they'll wake up after you pull their nuts out of the fire.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07768",
   "en": "We've got the weight of evidence on our side. You'll convince them.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07769",
   "en": "Please, Commander. You'll make me blush.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07770",
   "en": "Well, I wouldn't blame you. The way they sat back and looked all smug. Like they have clue one about what's going on out there.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07771",
   "en": "Yeah. I can't blame them, though. They've had a thousand years of peace. Who'd want to believe that's over?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07772",
   "en": "Finally, a reason to look forward to physical training.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
